{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 2360566,
  "courseSlug": "sveltejs-the-complete-guide",
  "courseTitle": "Svelte.js - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14689660",
      "title": "Binding Checkboxes & Radio Buttons",
      "lectureOrder": 85,
      "videoOrder": 75,
      "sourceHash": "b8eb0c59be46928847f657bcb532b2eedf0c572e6aefb38a6dfbdf3852ad1936",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.98,
          "end": 6.23,
          "en": "Now, of course, in your forms, you don't always just have text or number inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 14.71,
          "en": "You also have checkboxes and radio buttons and groups of checkboxes and so on and dropdowns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 14.73,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "So let's walk through these too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 17.19,
          "end": 22.56,
          "en": "Let's start with a checkbox by setting the type here on this input to checkbox.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 31.62,
          "en": "Let's all wrap it with a simple label here where I say agree to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 32.38,
          "end": 38.8,
          "en": "Terms and then to make sure that this is displayed correctly, make sure you move the input in front",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 38.8,
          "end": 40.81,
          "en": "of that label text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 40.96,
          "end": 44.68,
          "en": "So we got our input here and now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 45.87,
          "end": 49.62,
          "en": "You want to bind the value of that is possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 50.45,
          "end": 51.62,
          "en": "Yes, it is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 55.22,
          "end": 57.62,
          "en": "Let's add a new variable agreed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 60.7,
          "end": 65.88,
          "en": "And let's bind that to value here on this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 65.88,
          "end": 68.4,
          "en": "So bind value to agreed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 68.97,
          "end": 76.18,
          "en": "And before we have a look at this, let's also console log its value whenever this changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 76.2,
          "end": 77.61,
          "en": "So now I'm console logging.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 77.61,
          "end": 84.6,
          "en": "Agreed I bound it down there you see initially it's undefined if I now click this it stays undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 86.55,
          "en": "and it's not updated a second time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 86.88,
          "end": 92.81,
          "en": "Well for a checkbox you actually don't bind to value but to the checked property of the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 92.82,
          "end": 98.49000000000001,
          "en": "But as soon as you do that, if I click this, you see it switches from true to false and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 98.49000000000001,
          "end": 101.03999999999999,
          "en": "So this is how easy you can bind to a checkbox.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 101.03999999999999,
          "end": 102.75,
          "en": "Now what about a radio button?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 103.17,
          "end": 105.96000000000001,
          "en": "Well, these are simply presented in groups, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 105.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.47999999999999,
          "en": "So how can we bind to groups of data then?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 108.47999999999999,
          "end": 112.77000000000001,
          "en": "Let's say we have a couple of options down there, a couple of radio buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 113.67,
          "end": 118.89,
          "en": "Hence here I have a input of type radio and the value here could be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 119.75,
          "end": 122.24,
          "en": "Read because I'm asking for.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 123.11,
          "end": 124.04,
          "en": "The favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 125.18,
          "end": 126.35,
          "en": "Color or something like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 126.35,
          "end": 131.72,
          "en": "So we have a red radio button with a label next to it where we say red.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 131.99,
          "end": 133.94,
          "en": "Then I simply repeat that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 136.06,
          "end": 145.06,
          "en": "And I have two more radio buttons, one with green, where we say green on the label and one with blue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 145.09,
          "end": 147.19,
          "en": "where we also say blue here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 147.79,
          "end": 149.68,
          "en": "We now save that without any bindings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 149.68,
          "end": 150.64,
          "en": "This is what we get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 150.64,
          "end": 154.51,
          "en": "And by default, I can check them all because there is no connection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 154.93,
          "end": 157.51,
          "en": "Now we can give them a name here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 158.57999999999998,
          "end": 159.51,
          "en": "Color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 161.32,
          "end": 166.27,
          "en": "And if we assign that same name to all the inputs, then they are exclusive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 166.3,
          "end": 168.22,
          "en": "So now I can only select one of them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 168.34,
          "end": 170.5,
          "en": "But how can we now bind to that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 173.47,
          "end": 177.1,
          "en": "We can add a fav color here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 177.25,
          "end": 184.63,
          "en": "Set this to red initially maybe and then console log whenever fav color changes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 184.63,
          "end": 188.77,
          "en": "But how do we now bind this to this group of radio buttons?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 191.42,
          "end": 194,
          "en": "You can use bind group here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 194.04,
          "end": 201.26,
          "en": "You bind group to fav color and now all the items that are bound to the same group will update the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 201.26,
          "end": 202.88,
          "en": "variable depending on your choice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 202.88,
          "end": 208.85,
          "en": "So I'm setting this on all three radio buttons with the help of bind group which is set to fav color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 208.85,
          "end": 212.06,
          "en": "Now if I go back you see that this is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 213.15,
          "end": 215.37,
          "en": "Getting changed and even better than that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 215.7,
          "end": 218.37,
          "en": "If I set my initial value to green here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 219.31,
          "end": 224.14,
          "en": "On the fourth color variable, which is one of the values used on the radio button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 224.17000000000002,
          "end": 228.88,
          "en": "This one here, you will see that this radio button is pre-selected at the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 228.91,
          "end": 230.86,
          "en": "If I reload, this is pre-selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 230.89,
          "end": 236.02,
          "en": "So this is how you can easily bind to groups and that makes working with radio buttons and of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 236.02,
          "end": 236.98,
          "en": "also with checkboxes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 236.98,
          "end": 244.24,
          "en": "If you have these in a group, really simple because for checkboxes actually the items are not added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 244.24,
          "end": 249.67,
          "en": "stored as independent variables, but they're simply added together into an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 253.46,
          "end": 254.78,
          "en": "Could show this to you too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 254.81,
          "end": 259.73,
          "en": "Instead of true or false, the checkboxes then form simply an array of values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 259.73,
          "end": 267.35,
          "en": "So if we convert radio here to checkbox and leave the rest as it is, then you see, as I tick items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 267.35,
          "end": 269.09,
          "en": "this all gets added into an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 269.12,
          "end": 276.29,
          "en": "Of course we should then also store the initial value green here as an array so that it's not initially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 276.98,
          "end": 279.95,
          "en": "a string and only after ticking one item in array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 279.95,
          "end": 281.69,
          "en": "So this should be an array initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 281.72,
          "end": 287.54,
          "en": "You see green is pre-selected and now you can tick items as you want and you always get an array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 287.54,
          "end": 291.35,
          "en": "So this is how you can work with radio buttons and with checkboxes.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
